    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Adopts the fifteen unclaimed files of hiqlite/tests/cluster/ and maps each phase to the guarantee it establishes. Diagnoses F-017's recorded non-completion by execution rather than restating it: the suite is a single sequential test whose self-healing phase runs last, and the stall that prevents it from being reached is a connect-versus-publish race in Client::remote, localised here to the microsecond. Records eight defects and limits, including an unbounded wait, a success path that exits the process while a second test is running, and the fact that no cluster test has ever run with TLS enabled. Repairs no runtime behavior and modifies no test.\n",
    "title": "Adopt the cluster integration evidence surface"
